  "description": "SAQWEO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H59 N36 O5 Tb4 1+,2(H2 O1),N1 O3 1-,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 3 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 3 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 3 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.681-5.266 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.78-177.71°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(L1-2H)(L1-H)3(N3)4(O)](NO3)(CH3CN)·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
